UID:10054800-1776826800-1776913199@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING FRIDAY April 24th | Sneaky Miles
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, Apr 24\, 9pm-12am | $10 Cover Event Details and Tickets \nSneaky Miles is an indie folk band formed through open mic nights at the University of New Hampshire in the fall of 2019. Since forming\, Sneaky Miles has quickly become a local powerhouse in the New Hampshire Seacoast music scene.\n\nWhile the band began as a stripped-down trio\, Sneaky Miles has since expanded their live sound by teaming up with additional members on drums\, bass\, and pedal steel. The result is a high-energy performance and a sound that feels bigger than the sum of its parts\, blending heartfelt storytelling with driving folk-rock arrangements.\n\nFor fans of Caamp\, Noah Kahan\, The Lumineers\, Mumford & Sons\, and The Head and the Heart\, Sneaky Miles delivers a sound rooted in community\, connection\, and cathartic live shows. sneakymiles.com\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-april-24th-sneaky-miles/2026-04-22/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/637779410_1494734775994733_3750430347465596623_n-e1775229958454.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
