SUMMARY:Sonare Music Academy presents: Beethoven 32 Bicentennial Celebration Kick-Off
DESCRIPTION:Sonare Music Academy\, under the artistic direction of Dr. Hwa-Jin Kim\, proudly presents The Beethoven 32 Concert\, in collaboration with Freeburg Pianos. This landmark celebration brings together 32 pianists\, ages 14 to 88\, to perform all 32 Beethoven piano sonatas in one unforgettable week. The first event of its kind in North Carolina\, the festival honors Beethoven’s enduring spirit and the power of community through music. \nEvent Details and Tickets \nThe Schedule\nSunday\, April 19\, 3–6 PM – Freeburg Pianos\nOpening Reception and Piano Performance \nPerformers: Kevin Ayesh #11\, Op. 22 — Heather Lee #18\, Op. 31\, No. 3 — Tavenier #21\, Op. 53 —Polly Feitzinger #27\, Op. 90 — Deborah Belcher #30\, Op. 109 \nMonday\, April 20\, 6-8 PM – Piano Emporium\nPerformers: Elena Stephens #1\, Op. 2\, No. 1 — Matt Blanks #3\, Op. 2\, No. 3 — Judy Phillips #5\, Op. 10\, No. 1 — Monica Song #7\, Op. 10\, No. 3 — Melanie Thompson #12\, Op. 26 \nTuesday\, April 21\, 6-8 PM – Piano Emporium\nPerformers: Edward Lyrene (Eddie) #4\, Op. 7 — Carol McCollum #10\, Op. 14\, No. 2 — Odile Perrenoud #14\, Op. 27\, No. 2 — Randy Kern #15\, Op. 28 — Sharyn Edwards #23\, Op. 57 \nWednesday\, April 22\, 6-8 PM – Piano Emporium\nPerformers: Arabella Nienaber #6\, Op. 10\, No. 2 — Nolan Adcock #13\, Op. 27\, No. 1 — Victoria Fischer Faw #16\, Op. 31\, No. 1 — Ethan Abraham #25\, Op. 79 — Vance Reese #26\, Op. 81a \nThursday\, April 23\, 6-8 PM – Piano Emporium\nPerformers: Shirley Gruenhut #2\, Op. 2\, No. 2 — Katie Osborn #9\, Op. 14\, No. 1 — Elizabeth Child #17\, Op. 31\, No. 2 — Luccia Marguglio #19\, Op. 49\, No. 1 — Ashe Denny #20\, Op. 49\, No. 2 \nFriday\, April 24\, 6–8 PM – Freeburg Pianos\nPerformers: Renee Allsbrook #8\, Op. 13 — Leonidas Lagrimas #22\, Op. 54 — Muen Vanessa Wei #29\, Op. 106 — Hwa-Jin Kim #31\, Op. 110 \nSaturday\, April 25\, 4-7pm – Freeburg Pianos\nPerformers: Derek Parsons #24\, Op. 78 — Leslie Downs #28\, Op. 101 — John Cobb #32\, Op. 111 \n• 4–6 PM – Final Piano Performance at Freeburg Pianos \n• 6–7 PM – Raffle Winner Announcement and Closing Ceremony with Donors and Sponsors \nBeethoven Event Locations\nFreeburg Pianos: 2314 Asheville Hwy\, Hendersonville\, NC 28791 \nPiano Emporium: 828 Hendersonville Road\, Asheville\, NC 28803
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/sonare-music-academy-presents-beethoven-32-bicentennial-celebration-kick-off-2/2026-04-23/
LOCATION:Piano Emporium\, 828 Hendersonville Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
