SUMMARY:Mini Kiss w/ Smashing Mouths | The Showroom
DESCRIPTION:Thursday April 23\, 2026 || 6:30 PM – 10:30 PM || $16.91 Event Details and Tickets \nSome bands play tribute shows. Others turn them into a spectacle. On April 23\, the world-famous Mini Kiss storms The Showroom stage with a full-throttle\, KISS-inspired rock show that’s loud\, theatrical\, and completely unforgettable. Known around the globe for their electrifying performances\, this powerhouse group of talented little people has lit up stages everywhere from Jimmy Kimmel Live to HBO Live Sessions\, even appearing in the KISS Dr Pepper Super Bowl commercial. They’ve shared bills with artists like Snoop Dogg\, Peter Frampton\, Blue Öyster Cult\, and A Perfect Circle\, and in 2023 they set a Guinness World Record for the World’s Shortest Band. The costumes\, the attitude\, the larger-than-life rock energy. It’s all here.\n\n\nBefore the face paint and firepower hit the stage\, WNC’s own Smashing Mouths kicks off the night from 6:30pm . Known as Western North Carolina’s premier 90s and early 2000s nostalgia experience\, they bring a set packed with the singalong anthems and alt-rock favorites that defined a generation. It’s the perfect warmup before Mini Kiss takes over The Showroom and turns the room into a full-on rock arena.\nTwo bands. One very wild night.\n\n21+ Event\n  \nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/mini-kiss-w-smashing-mouths-the-showroom/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Screenshot-2026-03-30-123836-e1774888781386.png
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
